    "updated_at": "2021-10-25T08:50:55Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure how that helps. We know `refresh` is being used and we know it's used for redirects. We also know some percentage of users disable scripting, either directly or through an extension. Ergo, they end up with a broken experience.\r\n\r\n(And also, people using assistive technology don't necessarily disable scripting by the way; I'd expect that most don't (otherwise ARIA wouldn't work).)",
