    "created_at": "2025-11-14T06:14:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-14T06:14:41Z",
    "body": "I agree with @annevk that this would break client-side redirect fallback. Browsers that want to give users control of whether to follow redirects or not when scripting is disabled (or in general) can already do so with the current spec. Closing.",
